{"id":"en_before-your-love-reached-me","title":"Before Your Love Reached Me","titleEn":"Before Your Love Reached Me","description":"Mason Innes is convinced that Thea Kane caused the death of the woman he truly loved. Driven by a desire for vengeance, he carefully works his way into Thea's life, and his scheme ends with her taking her own life. Only after she is gone does Mason learn the shattering truth: the person actually responsible was someone else entirely. Consumed by remorse, he comes to understand that the past cannot be reversed. However violently his grief and guilt spill out, the damage is beyond repair and it is far too late for anything to be put right.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/before-your-love-reached-me/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/before-your-love-reached-me/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["BE","Her Journey","High Society","Misunderstanding","Paranormal","Toxic Relationship"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db9yi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_before-your-love-reached-me_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db9yi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_before-your-love-reached-me_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db9yi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_before-your-love-reached-me_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db9yi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_before-your-love-reached-me_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","la